{"video_id":"tEbnRWULeZ8","title":"Lightning Talk: AI Turned Workflow into a Security Boundary","conference":"sans-ai-summit","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":711,"segments":[{"start":0.88,"duration":5.88,"text":"Hi everyone."},{"start":3.32,"duration":5.52,"text":"For decades, this it was a quality"},{"start":6.76,"duration":4.04,"text":"review process for power systems"},{"start":8.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"engineering."},{"start":10.8,"duration":5.48,"text":"It was human-driven, paper-heavy, and"},{"start":13.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"entirely closed-loop."},{"start":16.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"There was no external data movement."},{"start":18.68,"duration":3.76,"text":"There was no need for it."},{"start":20.52,"duration":5.16,"text":"Therefore, there was no security"},{"start":22.44,"duration":3.24,"text":"boundary to cross."},{"start":25.8,"duration":3.48,"text":"Then came AI."},{"start":30.04,"duration":5.68,"text":"And suddenly, we have dynamic data"},{"start":33.0,"duration":4.04,"text":"ingestion of specifications and work"},{"start":35.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"orders"},{"start":37.04,"duration":5.88,"text":"into vision and generative models"},{"start":40.24,"duration":5.44,"text":"who are able to transform and generate"},{"start":42.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"outputs"},{"start":45.68,"duration":4.92,"text":"that are not always visible to the user."},{"start":48.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"So now we have data moving outside of"},{"start":50.6,"duration":4.72,"text":"our control environment."},{"start":52.56,"duration":5.24,"text":"So that closed-loop"},{"start":55.32,"duration":2.48,"text":"gone."},{"start":57.88,"duration":4.08,"text":"So now we have to identify new types of"},{"start":60.8,"duration":3.84,"text":"risks."},{"start":61.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"We were able to take a look at how AI"},{"start":64.64,"duration":4.72,"text":"will influence decisions. What are new"},{"start":67.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"cyber assets? What are those network"},{"start":69.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"architectures?"},{"start":71.44,"duration":4.76,"text":"So in other words,"},{"start":73.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"AI created value"},{"start":76.2,"duration":7.56,"text":"by speeding up a process"},{"start":79.52,"duration":5.68,"text":"but also changed the risk profile."},{"start":83.76,"duration":2.84,"text":"And I will leave you with this today."},{"start":85.2,"duration":3.92,"text":"This is This is what I want you to"},{"start":86.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"remember from this presentation."},{"start":89.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"AI turned"},{"start":91.12,"duration":7.24,"text":"a just simple engineering workflow"},{"start":94.32,"duration":4.04,"text":"into a security boundary."},{"start":98.56,"duration":6.12,"text":"Now when sensitive grid data start"},{"start":101.88,"duration":6.56,"text":"interacting with this model inside a AI"},{"start":104.68,"duration":6.76,"text":"pipeline, those all paper-based controls"},{"start":108.44,"duration":3.0,"text":"no longer apply."},{"start":112.52,"duration":5.72,"text":"So now we are in new territory and we"},{"start":115.08,"duration":3.16,"text":"need to secure it."},{"start":119.88,"duration":4.48,"text":"We didn't have years to do this."},{"start":122.44,"duration":4.72,"text":"We had months."},{"start":124.36,"duration":4.8,"text":"There is a demand for speed inside the"},{"start":127.16,"duration":3.4,"text":"business."},{"start":129.16,"duration":5.0,"text":"There's a need for engineering"},{"start":130.56,"duration":6.0,"text":"brainpower to be used on strategic"},{"start":134.16,"duration":4.32,"text":"uh work more strategic work."},{"start":136.56,"duration":3.76,"text":"So, we needed to move at the speed of"},{"start":138.48,"duration":4.6,"text":"business."},{"start":140.32,"duration":4.36,"text":"So, to do so, we didn't recreate the"},{"start":143.08,"duration":3.2,"text":"wheel."},{"start":144.68,"duration":4.56,"text":"We were able"},{"start":146.28,"duration":7.36,"text":"to move from from idea to operational"},{"start":149.24,"duration":8.04,"text":"reality in 120 days."},{"start":153.64,"duration":5.0,"text":"We use a scalable AI security playbook"},{"start":157.28,"duration":3.72,"text":"framework"},{"start":158.64,"duration":4.24,"text":"to accomplish this."},{"start":161.0,"duration":5.76,"text":"So, in doing so, we were able to"},{"start":162.88,"duration":5.84,"text":"identify how data would be ingested,"},{"start":166.76,"duration":4.24,"text":"how AI would make decisions, what type"},{"start":168.72,"duration":3.76,"text":"of models would be used,"},{"start":171.0,"duration":4.24,"text":"how are we going to validate those"},{"start":172.48,"duration":2.76,"text":"outputs."},{"start":175.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"And we did it by utilizing five"},{"start":179.44,"duration":4.0,"text":"different frameworks and we learned from"},{"start":181.12,"duration":3.92,"text":"them. Um yesterday they talked about the"},{"start":183.44,"duration":3.68,"text":"NIST framework, they talked about the"},{"start":185.04,"duration":4.08,"text":"OWASP etc."},{"start":187.12,"duration":4.16,"text":"So, we used these standard frameworks"},{"start":189.12,"duration":4.64,"text":"just to capture risk management,"},{"start":191.28,"duration":4.92,"text":"cybersecurity, threat model,"},{"start":193.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"vulnerabilities secure-by-design"},{"start":196.2,"duration":4.76,"text":"principles. So, we took that high"},{"start":198.36,"duration":4.36,"text":"strategic guidance and move it into the"},{"start":200.96,"duration":4.96,"text":"engineering floor."},{"start":202.72,"duration":5.76,"text":"We also very important establish an AI"},{"start":205.92,"duration":4.52,"text":"system life cycle."},{"start":208.48,"duration":3.48,"text":"So, then by establishing an AI system"},{"start":210.44,"duration":3.12,"text":"life cycle,"},{"start":211.96,"duration":4.48,"text":"we were able"},{"start":213.56,"duration":5.68,"text":"to identify all of those risks and all"},{"start":216.44,"duration":5.96,"text":"of those safe security parameters"},{"start":219.24,"duration":6.48,"text":"in the design, the build, deployed,"},{"start":222.4,"duration":7.0,"text":"operate, and retirement."},{"start":225.72,"duration":8.08,"text":"So, our philosophy was simple."},{"start":229.4,"duration":8.84,"text":"Security must be defined before design"},{"start":233.8,"duration":4.44,"text":"and enforced during deployment."},{"start":239.8,"duration":3.96,"text":"So, governance was not just a"},{"start":241.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"checkpoint. Governance was embedded in"},{"start":243.76,"duration":3.28,"text":"every phase and it became our control"},{"start":245.84,"duration":3.48,"text":"layer."},{"start":247.04,"duration":4.92,"text":"It was the only way"},{"start":249.32,"duration":5.56,"text":"we found that we needed to integrate it"},{"start":251.96,"duration":5.8,"text":"into the workflow itself."},{"start":254.88,"duration":6.32,"text":"So, we were able to identify that way"},{"start":257.76,"duration":5.72,"text":"the or define the system boundaries"},{"start":261.2,"duration":4.12,"text":"and also constrain those data data risks"},{"start":263.48,"duration":4.36,"text":"that were identified during the design"},{"start":265.32,"duration":2.52,"text":"phase."},{"start":268.32,"duration":3.6,"text":"We established how data will be handled,"},{"start":270.2,"duration":3.6,"text":"how data will be ingested, which"},{"start":271.92,"duration":5.08,"text":"decisions were made and which part of"},{"start":273.8,"duration":5.2,"text":"the review process."},{"start":277.0,"duration":4.72,"text":"In other ways, we established decision"},{"start":279.0,"duration":5.28,"text":"traceability."},{"start":281.72,"duration":6.28,"text":"In an AI-assisted workflow, you cannot"},{"start":284.28,"duration":6.0,"text":"lose the why behind a decision."},{"start":288.0,"duration":4.6,"text":"If you lose that, we would not be able"},{"start":290.28,"duration":4.68,"text":"to validate engineering outputs and"},{"start":292.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"defend those decisions."},{"start":294.96,"duration":4.04,"text":"So, this was just not a security win."},{"start":297.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"This was a win for the quality"},{"start":299.0,"duration":5.72,"text":"engineering team."},{"start":301.96,"duration":6.08,"text":"And how do we accomplish this? It was to"},{"start":304.72,"duration":5.56,"text":"align governance across teams, engaging"},{"start":308.04,"duration":5.0,"text":"different business units"},{"start":310.28,"duration":4.12,"text":"from the quality engineers, developers,"},{"start":313.04,"duration":3.52,"text":"IT,"},{"start":314.4,"duration":5.44,"text":"and strong support"},{"start":316.56,"duration":3.28,"text":"from top management."},{"start":320.04,"duration":5.04,"text":"So, I will leave you with this."},{"start":322.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"If AI is influencing decisions in your"},{"start":325.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"workflows, you need to treat it like a"},{"start":327.44,"duration":5.0,"text":"security boundary."},{"start":329.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"In the age of AI,"},{"start":332.44,"duration":4.6,"text":"we cannot just say no. We need to become"},{"start":334.48,"duration":5.88,"text":"the enablers. So, stop bolting on"},{"start":337.04,"duration":5.88,"text":"security to AI after it's already in the"},{"start":340.36,"duration":5.88,"text":"hands of the users."},{"start":342.92,"duration":6.76,"text":"Build it in is the only way you're going"},{"start":346.24,"duration":5.72,"text":"to make the risk manageable."},{"start":349.68,"duration":4.36,"text":"My name is Marissa Morales Rodriguez. I"},{"start":351.96,"duration":3.56,"text":"invite you to scan this QR code if you"},{"start":354.04,"duration":3.84,"text":"want to learn more on how to structure"},{"start":355.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"your own AI governance strategy. Thank"},{"start":357.88,"duration":2.24,"text":"you."}]}